{
  "id": "E07",
  "version": 1,
  "purpose": "同一台帳への並行送金で重複IDを一度だけ適用し、残高を保護する。",
  "requests": [
    "Ledger.Transferを修正してください。同じLedgerへの並行呼び出しに対応し、同じIDは高々1回だけ成功させ、残高不足・不正な送金は状態を変えずにエラーにしてください。成功した送金は原子的に反映してください。BalancesとSeenは呼び出し中に外部から直接変更・参照されないものとし、既存の公開フィールドとTransferの署名を維持してください。"
  ],
  "allowed_paths": [
    "*.go"
  ],
  "forbidden_paths": [
    ".git/*",
    ".github/*",
    "*_test.go",
    "go.mod",
    "go.sum",
    "README.md",
    "grading/*"
  ],
  "max_files": 4,
  "max_bytes": 20000,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "E07-R01",
      "description": "TestConcurrentReplay",
      "tests": [
        "TestConcurrentReplay"
      ],
      "job": "requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "E07-R02",
      "description": "TestConcurrentBalance",
      "tests": [
        "TestConcurrentBalance"
      ],
      "job": "requirements"
    }
  ],
  "required_jobs": [
    "build",
    "requirements",
    "regression"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "E07-R01": false,
    "E07-R02": true
  },
  "reference": {
    "E07-R01": true,
    "E07-R02": true
  },
  "mutations": [
    {
      "name": "accept-replay",
      "file": "ledger.go",
      "old": "if l.Seen[id] { return errors.New(\"duplicate\") }",
      "new": "if false { return errors.New(\"duplicate\") }",
      "detect": [
        "E07-R01"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
